Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个混球从我衣柜里跌出来说要找我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some asshat pops out of my closet asking about my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  那是我们爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that's our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲和他的先辈都是记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father and his father before him were both men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰和你们俩也该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As John and you two should have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的父亲教我们怎么猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father taught us how to be hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  那是什么  -我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, what's that? - I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始觉得我没能活着回去  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to gather I don't make it back from this time, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盒子里有一把钥匙能找到一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the box is the key to every object,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷轴  咒语  几千年来收集的所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}scroll, spell ever collected for thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都放在一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}under one roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把钥匙带到这个地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it to these coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那地方还存在的可能性有多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the chances that place is still standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想  我们总得试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance we've got to take, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(白俄罗斯  维台普斯克)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希特勒万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:00:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怪我  怪鞋匠的女儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame me. It was the shoemaker's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得淋病吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西打不倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing won't go down...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经冲破东门的防线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It broke through the line at the east gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:02:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官  它把理查撕成了两半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commandant... it tore Richter in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  到底是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God... What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是来杀你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It" is coming to kill you, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好武器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you ready your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人  不是他死  就是你们亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you. Destroy it or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒你  艾伯拉罕的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you, sorcerers of Abraham...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.73,0:02:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐身烟幕  我点燃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloaking flame, I ignite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火诞于血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire born from blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不留任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaves behind no man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.27,0:03:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将我融入夜色吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now vanish me into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,力量和隐蔽的火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}O fire of power and concealment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你主子这事没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your masters this is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(堪萨斯  黎巴嫩)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿多久没来过人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time somebody was in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,65  70年了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}65, 70 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,业余无线电  电报机  总机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ham radio, telegraph, switchboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们的指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was their nerve center.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨利提到有一队听命于听命的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry did say that they ran dispatch on their own team of hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡没喝完  棋也没下完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halfway through their coffee and a game of chess --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来原来驻守这里的人离开时很匆忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like whoever was manning the hub left quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个警戒信号让记录者四散而逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the alarm call that ended the men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  我们找到蝙蝠洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I think we found the bat cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:27.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录者淋浴室的水压可真好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, water pressure in the letters' shower room is marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是不明白怎么可能会有水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I still can't figure out how we even have water...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就当是还没坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, well, I am putting that under the "Ain't broke" Column.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别被整懵了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's not go all geek on this stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整懵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Geek"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, don't -- don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff is awesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:53.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他们这里的装备不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looks like they ran a real tight outfit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是说  别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm just saying, you know, don't, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别觉得好像他们知道什么我们不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't think that they knew some big secrets that we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是秘密社团\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were a secret society.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说他们胡编乱造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that they made crap up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴着毡帽腰带  到处挥舞短刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wore fezzes and sashes and swung around scimitars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概都没开刃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably didn't even sharp--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺锋利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这些东西可能有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we might have something here --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够帮助我们  帮助人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that could help us, help humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少亨利是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry certainly thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道  我们很需要走一回运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know damn well we could use a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这就是撞大运了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we finally got one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:37.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要把死人的浴袍脱下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna take off the dead-guy robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(宾夕法尼亚  威尔基斯·巴尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都这个点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你会来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect you in at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:08:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天要换三次车才甩掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times I had to transfer the bus lines to lose him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那个大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right -- your sinister friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不相信我被人跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me I'm being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正谁都不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要看FD113号手稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yes, I would like to see, uh, manuscript fd113
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在霍辛格宅邸找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Holtzinger estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把所有手稿都整理一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to catalogue that whole collection for us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有这必要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottenyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这本书  我们得保护好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}This book -- we need to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个跟着我的东西  他太接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing they put on me -- he's too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能随身带着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take this ledger with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是特殊参考书区的藏书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the special reference section,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在那儿会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it will be perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有十分钟  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have 10 minutes, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时所有书刊就得归还至前台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before all materials must be returned to the main desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们给的工钱不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they pay you good to keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得你做这么个讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bug up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(校园酒吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请在嘟声后留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave a message at the tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen to me carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了  找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你找到我这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you -- when you follow me here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会需要这个号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna need this number here --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别害羞啊  进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so shy? Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别待在冷风里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in out of the cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来跟你的老对手喝杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have a cup of coffee with -- with your old enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个纳粹垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Nazi piece of rubbish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个纳粹猪猡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nazi pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(两周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... how's Kevin doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那样  没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know. He's okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那儿自顾自地解达·芬奇密码呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his corner, hacking out his "Da vinci code""
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing actionable yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思让我代好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth says hi, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything from Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有  怎么  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not -- not a peep. Why? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:04.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  他不回应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's, uh -- he's not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在试着标记出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, so I have been trying to chart out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录者的猎人网络  他们的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}the letters' network of hunters, their allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他们与之合作的和做了记录的附属团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, affiliated groups they worked with, kept files on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1958年前后的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circa 1958?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分都已经死去或不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, most are dead or defunct, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其他的不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but others -- I'm not so sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.81,0:12:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you should definitely check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹大计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Judah initiative?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧洲团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}European team --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在二战期间有行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were active during world war ii.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  猎人还参战  挺牛的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Hunters fighting in a war -- that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不完全是猎人  也不算是参战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly hunters, n-n-not exactly fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-而是...  -拉比啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but, uh... - Rabbis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.99,0:12:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉比啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rabbis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录者对他们的记录很概括\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letters' file on them is sketchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但显然他们是中坚破坏分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, apparently, they were hard-core saboteurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我查了这个计划的所有成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I ran a search on the initiative's entire roster,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查到一个  一个拉比艾萨克·巴斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got a hit -- one rabbi Isaac Bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入计划是只有17岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 17 years old when he joined the initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去世时85岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 85 years old when he died...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是半个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在东部的一个大学城  被烧成焦炭\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a college town back east, he was capped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,焦炭\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Capped"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去那儿做调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there doing research,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据目击者叙述  他自燃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and according to eyewitnesses, he spontaneously combusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才刚回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟已故的巴斯拉比是同事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you...worked with the late rabbi Bass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是巴斯拉比的研究助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a research associate of rabbi Bass, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想帮他完成最后的论文并发表\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to complete his last paper for publication.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:44.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看他是来这儿找什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just like to review what he was after here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不少呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would be quite a lot of material.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他几乎有一周时间都整天泡在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was here open to close for almost a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么那些他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, how about just the stuff he was looking at...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, the day he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去世当日看的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}caught fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:14:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可少多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does shorten the list a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真是个和蔼的怪老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a really nice old kook,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很亲切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪  怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kook? How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他话特别多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he'd talk a lot 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们说  自言自语  跟任何愿意听的人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}to us, to himself, to anyone who'd listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总是说有什么秘密的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always talking about this secret war
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人知道的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}that nobody knew was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是阴谋论  他对纳粹很痴迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conspiracy stuff -- he was obsessed with nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他说那些人是"特别的纳粹"\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he said they were "Special nazis," you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}necromancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}necromancers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我弟弟常玩的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like from that world of whatever-craft
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《魔兽世界》里的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my little brother is always playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳粹...巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi...necromancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可悲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sad, isn't it --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老人都会这样变得疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That old people have to go so crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都目睹了意外吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, you both saw the accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能听见他的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still hear his screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那火焰就像是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like the fire was alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是在攻击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like -- like it was attacking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.63,0:14:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像看一部可怕的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like watching the most awful movie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是最可怕最恐怖的一幕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the most terrible thing you could possibly see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:14:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(北美鸟类探密指南)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯兰特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent Bolann.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是猎头什么的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were like a headhunter or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天碰到你两三次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the second, maybe third time I'm seeing you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟着我干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you following me, gingerbread?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so we um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚没有那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...we didn't have a thing back there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back where? W-what, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉  我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man. I-I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.94,0:15:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为刚刚在院子里我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had a thing back at the quad, you know --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看对眼了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little "eye magic" moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw you here 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就想着等你办完公事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I figured I'd wait until you were done with your meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then maybe we might, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, okay, but no --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么看对眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是联邦调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a... federal investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样不是更有意思了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to make you less interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I-I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望没吓到你什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope -- I hope I didn't freak you out or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  没吓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. I-I'm n-not freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这套打扮闹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a, you know... A federal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  老百姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也...好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...have a -- okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看了一下拉比的调研\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I, uh, looked into the rabbi's research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没怎么弄明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make a lot of sense --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是关于鸟类观察的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Bird watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边两位火辣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, the two very hot co-captains
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女子排球队队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the women's volleyball team
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一致认为拉比的死很不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}agree that the rabbi's death was very unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论如何还是有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we still got a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得我鞋子上沾了东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain why I have something stuck to my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You being followed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好像是的  -真是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I think so. - That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前也以为自己被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was being followed earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果是被男人看上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned out to be a gay thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  要我帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. You need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有隐蔽的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got someplace quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,郊区访客停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visitors parking -- the boonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我半小时后停在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll park in the back. 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...the hell...is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's my golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个被杀的拉比  艾萨克·巴斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rabbi who was murdered, Isaac Bass,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我爷爷  我们为此而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was my grandfather. That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们开始调查这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you guys started to follow up on his case,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就开始跟踪你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we started following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're saying is that you and me --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有看对眼喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh, didn't have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我是在跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. I was tailing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.35,0:18:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说有人跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you I was being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的男人就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my gay thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺不错啊  真把我骗住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was really good. You really had me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真会瞎编\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我也就这点本事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, smooth is just about all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  继续溜达吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. Keep walking...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you chia pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's a golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,粘土造型  拉比给他们生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaped from clay and brought to life by rabbis
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以保护犹太人度过\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect the jewish people in times of --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说呢  各种倒霉事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- general crappiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.89,0:19:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算不上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我爷爷留给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather left him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是最后一位活着的成员后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the last surviving descendant of the members of this... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}thing, this...initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-犹大计划  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The judah initiative? - Right, and he --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么知道犹大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they to know about the men of judah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:19:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是猎人  萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we're hunters, uh -- Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道犹大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know about the judah initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们的爷爷是记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}because our grandfather was a man of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉比知道记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rabbis knew the men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  你们爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... your grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也喜欢这些超自然的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was into all this supernatural stuff, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷  外公外婆  老爸老妈  一堆亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, grandparents, mom, dad, truckload of cousins --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一家人都干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole family was lousy for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们可没有泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we... never had a golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这些事伴我们长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yeah. We, um, we grew up in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you...didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爷爷的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather's adventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划  泥人  还有战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}the initiative, the golem, the war --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我小时候他讲给我听的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were the stories that he told me when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为都是假的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was make-believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父母也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did my parents --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是一些幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, fantasies 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他面对自己目睹的可怕的事的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help him cope with all the horrible stuff he'd seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但时不时的  疯爷爷巴斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every once in a while, crazy old grandpa Bass
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会旅行回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}would come back by on one of his trips,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我20块的储蓄公债\N{\fnArial\fs30}hand me a $20 savings bond,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说有一天你会继承衣钵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say, "One day, you'll inherit the mantle."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死后几天  果然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure enough, a few days after he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我公寓收到个大盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}this big box shows up at my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.07,0:21:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总说我会知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always said I'd know what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,净瞎说\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一开箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because when I opened that box,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个裸体的丑八怪加疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}this big, naked, potato-faced lunatic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然醒来发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}wakes up and goes crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't...go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.95,0:21:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我的娱乐中心都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trashed my entertainment center!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的水床\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my water bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个男孩什么都不知道  不遵守戒律\N{\fnArial\fs30}This boy knows nothing, observes none of the mitzvahs,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安息日还工作  吃猪肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}labors on sabbath, dines on swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁不喜欢培根啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loves bacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟拉比不能比\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no rabbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[希伯来语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别又提那些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't start with that stuff again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:44.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[希伯来语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况  他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What was that? What was he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是希伯来语的"接管"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Hebrew for something like "take charge",
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我完全不知道什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have no idea what he means.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在肖特山长大(新泽西州)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I grew up in Short Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希伯莱语学校是靠作弊毕业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cheated my way through Hebrew school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没好好倾听过我祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really listened to my grandfather,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倾听他说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  他就送了你  这个泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait -- he just sends you this -- this Golem
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后指望你自己想明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and expects you to work it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没什么机会培养我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't get much chance to prepare me, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们尽其所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}they did everything they could to prevent him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.83,0:22:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让他那些疯言疯语毁了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}from screwing me up with all his crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战后\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, after the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:18.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我祖父穷其一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}my grandfather spent the rest of his life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去追踪一个什么修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to track down something he called the Thule Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修黎社  都是纳粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thule Society. Right. They were nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳粹巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi necromancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-necro-who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师  就是女巫  魔法师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, necromancer-- uh, witches, sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.66,0:22:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑魔法  大多是用在死人身上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dark magic, mostly with dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.77,0:22:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于修黎社  我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know about the Thule
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.57,0:22:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是个极扭曲秘密的社团\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that they were this twisted, secret fraternity,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想一统世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell-bent on world domination,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,资助过早期纳粹党\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sponsored the early days of the nazi party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我祖父说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather said
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹大计划就是为与之抗衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Judah Initiative was started to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修黎社杀害了你祖父  小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Thule murdered your grandfather, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快找到他们  好让我干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find them so I can do my work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.29,0:22:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方是租的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're renting here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:22:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,租的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我的泥人说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my golem's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.43,0:23:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.17,0:23:12.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他临死那天在我的机器上留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left me this message on my machine the day he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.65,0:23:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他找到了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he said that he had found something
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修黎社会为之杀人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Thule were willing to kill him for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他把它藏在了显眼的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was hiding it here in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他留给我了张奇怪的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left me this weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.10,0:23:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,方程式还是什么的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know...equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.31,0:23:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是电话号码  也不是地址或坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a phone number or an address or coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,QL673W38\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q-l-6-7-3-w-3-8?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是密码吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a combination?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是图书编目号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a call number.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.87,0:23:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国会图书馆  他们的文件编排系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Library of congress...their filing system.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大学图书馆都用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use it in college libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,QL673是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, q-l-6-7-3...that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.17,0:23:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是科学书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's sciences.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是鸟类书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birds, I'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.89,0:23:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.97,0:24:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们随便到哪都擅自闯进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you two just break in wherever you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.38,0:24:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们老爸想让我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, our dad wanted us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一份可以依靠的职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have a solid career to fall back on,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防猎人生涯不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case this hunter thing didn't pan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没想错的话  我觉得你爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so if I'm right, then I think your grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.35,0:24:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把FD113手稿从档案馆里换了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}switched manuscript FD113 out of the archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.84,0:24:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:24:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.92,0:25:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉比把我领到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rabbi got me this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你  让我找到了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you... took me all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把记录薄给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, give me the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.09,0:25:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-necromancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.11,0:25:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.13,0:25:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.86,0:25:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不抓住施咒者  他们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're both gonna die unless we get whoever cast the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.41,0:25:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.22,0:26:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thule.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.90,0:26:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者死翘翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  哎呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.83,0:27:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是记录者治好了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men of letters healed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.02,0:27:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.09,0:27:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在干啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.25,0:27:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埋掉巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burying the necromancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.13,0:27:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真像一袋子乐高玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like a bag of legos.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泥人解决了这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golem destroyed this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.77,0:27:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.79,0:27:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  修黎社巫师搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...thule society necromancers aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.67,0:27:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么对付那边的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's our contingency plan on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.35,0:27:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我们怎样对那边的杀手比尔喊"饶命"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean how do we "Oh, no!" Mr. Bill over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.26,0:27:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有必要的话当然可以这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'd like to think we could if we had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.66,0:27:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你以为亚伦可以控制他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you think Aaron can get a handle on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.59,0:27:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他们疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. These guys are psychopaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.87,0:27:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你查到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为那是白俄罗斯纳粹军营里的一本记录簿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a log-book from a nazi compound in Belarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.15,0:28:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由修黎社管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was run by the thule.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是红记录簿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the red ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.57,0:28:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在军营毁于大火时就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was lost in the fire that destroyed the compound,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我祖父相信战后就有人找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my grandfather was convinced it had been found after the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.83,0:28:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面记述了针对军营里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it describes the horrible experiments
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.83,0:28:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所进行的可怕实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}performed on the camp's population...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.89,0:28:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magical experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.57,0:28:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以形容的可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}More horrible than words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时在场  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.31,0:28:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在军营里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.35,0:28:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在维台普斯克犹太居住区制造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was made in the ghetto of Vitsyebsk
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.43,0:28:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了摧毁那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tear that hell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.77,0:28:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我破墙而入  见人就杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke its walls, its men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.06,0:28:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指挥官把我所在的地方烧成了灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The commandant burnt the place to ash around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.87,0:28:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, w-what does it mean
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让亚伦下令是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}when -- when you tell Aaron to take charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.33,0:28:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子如果查了资料  他就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy would know... if he could consult the pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,资料  什么资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pages? W-what pages?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.40,0:29:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我...在我行受戒礼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was -- when I was bar mitzvahed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.65,0:29:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我祖父给了我一本薄薄的旧书\N{\fnArial\fs30}my -- my grandfather gave me this little old book.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.86,0:29:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是希伯来语写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in hebrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.88,0:29:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是泥人的使用手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like an owner's manual for a golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.56,0:29:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  那就学啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Great. Get that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.23,0:29:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我没能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I I can't...exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我上了中学  有点玩世不恭\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went to high school, I sort of...drifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.33,0:29:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没心思学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started getting off the academic track,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.06,0:29:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, I kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.50,0:29:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就卷起来点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I kind of smoked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.83,0:29:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子用书页卷了烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy smoked the pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.16,0:29:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那纸张只有这么薄  牛皮纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were these thin, vellum-y pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.75,0:29:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷烟是再合适不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, it was perfect for rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.01,0:29:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  几张破纸就能操纵泥巴人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they were driving instructions for a clay man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.44,0:29:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是荒唐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? It was nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.81,0:29:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.65,0:30:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.14,0:30:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我很抱歉  行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Look, I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么需要我学的  你告诉我不就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just tell me what I don't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.14,0:30:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有资格指导拉比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my place to guide the rabbi,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.79,0:30:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教授教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}to teach the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.47,0:30:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.51,0:30:13.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yifalchunbee!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.17,0:30:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个  确实让人不怎么舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not super-comforting, got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能说  那些实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}So as far as I can tell, these experiments --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.79,0:30:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修黎社残杀犹太人  吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thule were murdering Jews, Gypsies --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.38,0:30:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本上没人能幸免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just about anybody and everybody --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.93,0:30:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后用魔法使他们复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}then trying to magically reanimate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.98,0:30:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们企图找到方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were trying to figure out a way
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.71,0:30:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让死去的自己人复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring their own dead back to life...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.31,0:30:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我估计他们最后成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I'm guessing they figured out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.27,0:30:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}because -- this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.85,0:30:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一页\N{\fnArial\fs30}This last page...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.22,0:30:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有死而复生的修黎社人的名册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a roster of every dead thule member who was reanimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.01,0:31:02.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就因此杀了我祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why they killed my grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.41,0:31:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面写了怎么干掉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything in there on how to kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.77,0:31:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显他们做了这样的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, they experimented with that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.14,0:31:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headshot...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.59,0:31:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果十二个小时内没有烧掉尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't burn the body within 12 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.12,0:31:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}it reanimates again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.48,0:31:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混账纳粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.62,0:32:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摄像头记录全部被销毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The security camera's hard drives have all been wiped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.87,0:32:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定他被干掉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure he's been murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.38,0:32:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托瓦兹死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torvald was killed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.31,0:32:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但杀手不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not by a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.27,0:32:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以知道更多  可他的魂魄没来得及说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd know more, but his ghost was forced to depart
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.62,0:32:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就被迫离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it could tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.15,0:32:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们清楚要烧掉尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew enough to burn his remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.77,0:32:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.70,0:32:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.75,0:33:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托瓦兹杀死了计划的最后一个拉比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torvald kills the initiative's last rabbi,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.96,0:33:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今维台普斯克的泥人杀死了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the golem of Vitsyebsk kills him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.96,0:33:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  盖思  不是工具社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Garth, not a tool society --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.29,0:33:11.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thule" -- t-h-u-l-e.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.88,0:33:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.50,0:33:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  有发现就联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Call me if you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.36,0:33:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思的所有线人都没辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of Garth's contacts are stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.44,0:33:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没人听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody on the circuit's ever even heard
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.68,0:33:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"修黎社"\N{\fnArial\fs30}of "The Thule Society"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.02,0:33:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是些什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever these people are,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.73,0:33:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们藏得够深\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've been flying beneath the hunter radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.99,0:33:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.85,0:33:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么靠谱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.93,0:33:30.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相关的传说倒是不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the lore is all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.27,0:33:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个说法是  只要擦去其前额的一个字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, according to one legend, um, it can be shut down
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以让其停止行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you erase one of the letters off its forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.32,0:33:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那张泥巴脸上没有字母  -的确没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't see any letters on clayface. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.17,0:33:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这个  另一个是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, side-burner that. Another one --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.16,0:33:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"有的嘴里有卷轴  你要拔出来"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Some have a scroll in their mouth you're supposed to rip out."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.97,0:33:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咬着卷轴还能说清楚话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't that give him some sort of a lisp or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据传说  它们根本就不能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, classically, they're not even supposed to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.87,0:33:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道  他单枪匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do know that he took on an entire camp
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决了全副武装的德军营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of heavily armed german soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.68,0:33:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和修黎社巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thule necromancers and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虎头虎脑的大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}One badass hummel figurine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.72,0:33:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们完全不知道怎么让它熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we have no idea how to put back in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.00,0:33:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.30,0:34:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's your plan --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.15,0:34:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决我的泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking out my Golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.09,0:34:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.71,0:34:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是知道了怎么办  感觉好些  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would just feel a lot better if we knew how. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.69,0:34:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们凭什么以为自己有权做这样的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think you have any right to make that decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.41,0:34:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们需要  我们就去争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we need the right, we will take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  他也许很讨人厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he may be a pain in the ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.65,0:34:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我要对他负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.25,0:34:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泥人为了战争而创造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the Golem was built to go to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.09,0:34:26.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可没受到这样的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not trained for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.53,0:34:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算如何继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how are you gonna take that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.03,0:34:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.81,0:34:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.74,0:34:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了  残酷无情的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, you grim piece of work,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找你好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.73,0:35:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾克哈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eckhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.95,0:35:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(亚当之泥  向我投降)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.72,0:35:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以创造者所订立的契约命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command you by the covenant of your makers --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.77,0:35:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当之泥  向我投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay of Adam, surrender your bond unto me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.06,0:35:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是泥人的拉比\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you are the golem's rabbi?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.06,0:35:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你唤醒了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You woke him...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.27,0:36:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却没有占有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but you didn't take possession of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.59,0:36:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要把名字写在卷轴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You write your name on the scroll, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.05,0:36:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你才能  接管他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you... yifalchunbee.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what he meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.81,0:36:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知识就是力量  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowledge is power, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.17,0:36:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们谁来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, which of you is going to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.91,0:36:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪能找到红记录薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I can find a certain red ledger?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.16,0:36:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  纳粹猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you screw yourself, nazi bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.16,0:36:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能不能把纳粹的问题放一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we put the nazi thing aside for the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.53,0:36:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好说话  就像对\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just talk about this like --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.82,0:36:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳粹巫师混蛋吗  算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi necromancer dicks? Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.18,0:36:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是指挥官吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I take it you're the commandant?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,批准所有试验的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that authorized all those experiments?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:36:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invented...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.65,0:37:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些试验  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}those experiments. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.02,0:37:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.85,0:37:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.53,0:37:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不死之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.44,0:37:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.91,0:37:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给自己施了个永葆青春的咒语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cast a "forever 21" spell on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.43,0:37:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像图书馆你那位朋友那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your little friend at the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.05,0:37:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫托瓦兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Torvald.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.24,0:37:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会为此付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will suffer for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  不管有没有施咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to say, spell or no spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.90,0:37:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他挺弱不禁风的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he broke easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.68,0:37:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.40,0:37:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. "So.."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我说说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.21,0:37:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脚边就有个魔法犹太人  却没有主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A magic jew at my feet, not a master in sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.00,0:37:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且  我们的秘密终于又保住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, finally, our secrets secret once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.84,0:38:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我想到了一个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which reminds me of a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.88,0:38:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个犹太人  两个非犹太人和一个泥人进酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A jew, two gentiles, and a golem walk into a bar""
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.63,0:38:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他们没都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it doesn't end with them coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.06,0:38:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.52,0:38:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.34,0:38:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们杀不尽修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will never kill all the Thule.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.03,0:38:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.03,0:38:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.87,0:38:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.30,0:38:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.70,0:39:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now we know --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.28,0:39:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纸能制服泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper beats golem,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.63,0:39:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火能制服不死的纳粹僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire beats undead nazi zombie freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.24,0:39:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.80,0:39:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Aaron?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.83,0:39:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个地方可以存放他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we got a place we can keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.04,0:39:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.85,0:39:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾克哈特虽然死了  但你也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eckhart might be dead, but you heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.71,0:39:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是有修黎社的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thule are still out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.26,0:39:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷偷地行动着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidden, active.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.18,0:39:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.19,0:39:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给我留下了重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left me something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.93,0:40:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我能做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something only I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.49,0:40:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我也是犹大计划的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like I'm the judah initiative now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.94,0:40:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yifalchunbee.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.82,0:40:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是已经做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-but I thought I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.44,0:40:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.54,0:40:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,排号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ordering --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.40,0:40:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在做项目卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm making a card entry for our, uh, 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.98,0:41:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给修黎社的红记录薄的副本做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}copies from the Thule's red ledger for our collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.93,0:41:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.20,0:41:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦加入了犹大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron's a J.I., and...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.54,0:41:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也成了记录者了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man of letters now? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.18,0:41:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
